{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-06/1065836/block/singleImage/3278657/df/01KVYEJNFZ0XKF6KN1C1S31WH5.jpg?updatedAt=1795666512\"/><figcaption>藍田康盈苑。（Google地圖截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>藍田康盈苑發生懷疑猝死案。 今日（26日）早上7時許，一名男子於藍田碧雲道225號康盈苑住所內暈倒，其女朋友發現後報警。警方和救援人員接報後趕至現場，經檢驗後，證實男子已經明顯死亡。警方證實死者為46歲姓嚴男子，將案件列作「屍體發現」處理，將安排驗屍確定死因，正在調查事件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T05:41:21.580890+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T04:15:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T18:37:36.285280+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T05:34:44.282695+00:00","content_hash":"5d302a64855b043e45de7a179a11ddc95b9b09aab0610eac05acf4369bf73c0b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T05:41:21.580890+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}